   "text": "IonQ's 2030 target is 2 million qubits.\n\nThat's not the number that matters.\n\nThis one does: ~80,000.\n\nThose are logical qubits — the error-corrected, stable ones that actually run algorithms. Physical qubits are noisy, so many get bundled into each reliable logical qubit.\n\nMuch",
